      "description": "Sign in to your account Sign in Can’t access your account? Can’t log in? Contact help@london.edu.\nThis and associated School services are provided to authorised users only. Use of these services is governed by UK law and School policy. Services may be monitored for regulatory compliance and operational purposes. Sign-in options Terms of use Privacy & cookies ..."
